      "note": "hydo's own programs, scripts and documents. examples/ledger-spin/bin/spin_load and spin_count are hv/hvm/spin/spinvar.c compiled with -nostdlib (no library code). guest/hydo_fc is hydo/onboard/hydo_fc.c linked statically with the Arm GNU Toolchain's glibc and libgcc (below; its source is in the sources archive, so it can be relinked with a modified glibc). The rest of hydo's source is its repository at the commit `hydo --version` names."
